    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5703" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixellum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixillum</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 15, 20, § 115</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Inscr. Murat. 239</span></i>),
		i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in</i> Gallia Cisalpina, <i>on
				the Po</i>, <i>between Parma and Mantua</i>, now
				<i>Brescello</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 49,
				50, § 163</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 2,
			33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 51</span></i>; 2, 54; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Oth. 9</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixillānus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <i>of Brixellum</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 3734</span></i>.</div>
